# A Borg cube assimilates a Klingon destroyer with its Holding Beam. Both ships are set to green alert so nothing fires.
# The cube is selected, F4 is pressed, and the destroyer clicked (the special step). The beam sends a 20-crew boarding
# party through the destroyer's shields each second, and once the parties outnumber its crew the destroyer is captured:
# it ends on team 1 with the race borg and the beam ends.
# Run it with --layout layouts/borg-assimilation.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.5
select Victim
press Shift+G
select Cube
press Shift+G
expect Victim team = 2
expect Victim race = klingon
special 4 Victim
wait 20
dump assimilated
expect Victim team = 1
expect Victim race = borg
